## Model card

- **Name:** Llama 3.2 11B Vision Instruct
- **Short description:** Meta's instruction-tuned 11B multimodal model (released 2024-09-25) optimized for visual recognition, image reasoning, captioning and visual Q&A.
- **Provider / access:** Self-hosted (Hugging Face `meta-llama/Llama-3.2-11B-Vision-Instruct`, Llama community licence), NVIDIA NIM, plus hosted lanes.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2024-09-25; knowledge cutoff 2023-12 (per the Llama 3.2 card).
- **IDs:** `llama_3.2_vision_instruct`, `meta-llama/Llama-3.2-11B-Vision-Instruct`. (A hyphen-spelling duplicate folder was merged + deleted 2026-11-06 — never recreate it.)
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens (Llama 3.2 family).
- **Modalities:** text and image in; text out; tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** open weights (Llama community licence); hosted lanes ~$0.35/1M blended (benchleader).
- **Architecture:** dense 11B vision-language model (Meta).

